;Trying to purchase recalled item, assumes already logged in
Alias ScanField 90 674
Alias "Complete sale" 1758 740
alias dialog 506 366

Assert color 90 16 #000080 ;ensures someone is logged in

SetText ScanField 9400539150060 ;recalled item
PressKey Enter
Sleep 5000

;try to detect dialog box 
assert memo dialog "Item has been RECALLED! Do NOT allow customer to take this item."

//MouseClick 482 476 //OK button on dialog
ClickButton formDlg Ok ;482 476 //OK button on dialog
Sleep 500
